{"reviews":[{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-0","r":5.0,"t":"\ud83d\udc4d\ud83c\udffc","x":"I normally buy sex kitten eyeliner from tarte but I find this to be the same quality. Goes on very nicely","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-1","r":5.0,"t":"Be careful of all the maneating","x":"This is a great eyeliner. Goes on smooth, great look. But be warned: it will make you eat men.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-2","r":5.0,"t":"I love this liner!!","x":"I love this liner! I am on my third one and don't want to use anything else now! My eyes always look on point because this liner stays sharp with just a turn of the lid. It's smooth and doesn't drag on my eyelid. It doesn't smear easily, but if I make a mistake during application, I can fix it quickly without having to remove all of my eye makeup. Excellent product!!","h":5,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-3","r":5.0,"t":"Buy it","x":"My favorite eyeliner. Smooth and precise. It does have to be replaced more frequently but the product is worth it","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-4","r":2.0,"t":"Doesn't last long","x":"The first time I purchase this product, it lasted for three months (once daily use). It was pretty good so I bought it again. The second time I purchased it, the product only lasted for a month (with daily use). Though I can't see inside, I assume the crayon was much shorter in the second one. Twenty plus dollars for eyeliner a month is way more than I'm interested in spending, when you can purchase other brands for around $5 and they last longer. I won't be buying this one again.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-5","r":3.0,"t":"Decent, basic.","x":"Bought as a replacement for Tarte Sex Kitten as it is half the cost. Overall, this is a little bit firmer and waxier than the Sex Kitten, but since I only use it for tightlining, it's just fine. I don't get the self-sharpening thing; it seems wasteful, so I just don't screw the cap on all the way. Would not recommend for wings or fine detail work. Good for tightlining and basics.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-6","r":4.0,"t":"Lasts all day but hard to apply","x":"I love that it's self-sharpening, and it definitely lasts all day! But there's something about the texture that makes it easy to make mistakes as you apply it. It's like it almost goes on too easy to where I often end up with uneven lines after barely touching my eye. And then it's hard to fix the lines because it stays on so well. I'm not sure if I'd buy this again.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-7","r":2.0,"t":"Amazing. Using it","x":"The quality? Amazing. Using it? Totally sub-par. I couldn't get the eyeliner to extend. I got basically 7 days of use out of $21.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-8","r":5.0,"t":"Easy to apply and stays put!","x":"My favorite eyeliner ever.  Very easy to apply and stays on--no blurring or under eye darkness or smudges.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-9","r":1.0,"t":"Do not buy","x":"Do not buy. Not worth the money.  It didn\u2019t even last a month. What\u2019s the point of having \u201cself sharpening\u201d when there\u2019s nothing to sharpen? The pencil doesn\u2019t extend at all.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-10","r":3.0,"t":"Smudgy","x":"Goes on well but gets very smudgy after a just a few hours of wearing. I have gone back to using my old eyeliner if I need it to say on for more than a couple of hours.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-11","r":1.0,"t":"Dont waste ur money!!!","x":"HORABLIE COULNT EVEN USE IT IT WONT EVEN GO UP TO USE SMH","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-12","r":2.0,"t":"Starts out smooth to apply, dries up quickly","x":"This product was easy to use at first. After a while, the eyeliner dried up and did not apply smoothly. Last week the eyeliner products tip broke off several times. I even ended up stepping on a broken off tip and tracked eyeliner on the bathroom floor. If you use a lot of eyeliner in a short amount of time, great...get this eyeliner. If not, buy another product that does not dry out as quickly.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-13","r":5.0,"t":"The best eyeliner!!","x":"This is my very first review ever. I love this product!! The best eyeliner I have ever used and I have used a lot of them. Love the self sharpening.  Just make sure you adjust it enough to reach the sharpener by pushing in the end to lengthen the pencil. Alittle bit of a learning curve. The tip stays pointed. It lasts all day no need to touch up.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-14","r":5.0,"t":"My New Favorite Eyeliner","x":"Better than expected - and now I\u2019m in love. I\u2019m hesitant to buy new eyeliner because I loved my old brand. After it was discontinued, I had no choice. I trust this brand and I love everything about the eyeliner! It\u2019s smooth, not too thick or thin. Easy application.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-15","r":1.0,"t":"Did not last","x":"I am extremely dissatisfied with this order. The product is supposed to be self sharpening and it is not. Also no way to adjust to get the rest of eyeliner stick to come out to use. Very disappointing. I had for 2 weeks and need more eyeliner again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-16","r":5.0,"t":"Stays put!!!","x":"This eyeliner glides on smooth and does not melt or smudge or cause racoon eyes! Care must be taken when applying because when it goes on, it stays on! The best vegan eyeliner I have tried so far and I have tried many!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-17","r":1.0,"t":"Waste of money!!","x":"Supposed to be self-sharpening, but all mine did was go flat, not \"sharpen\" and wasted my money. I'll NEVER buy this product again. I wish I could give it zero stars.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-18","r":1.0,"t":"Old and dry","x":"The product was old! Every time I use it It breaks. Nothing like I get from QVC. There product is always good. I want order this product from Amazon anymore!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-19","r":1.0,"t":"Product not to liking","x":"The first time I tried to turn to extend the highlighter it wouldn't extend making me believe it has been used.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-20","r":5.0,"t":"Fabulous black liner","x":"Love the self-sharpening feature! The color os super black and stays put in my waterline. Recommend!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-21","r":5.0,"t":"Nice product!","x":"I love the fact that this is self-sharpening.  Goes on very nice.  No eye irritation either!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-22","r":5.0,"t":"I love this product!","x":"I LOVE it! My only concern is that you just don\u2019t know when you\u2019re running out.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-23","r":1.0,"t":"Try another Tarte liner","x":"The tip broke off twice and the sharpener won\u2019t sharpen it","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B01MTD1F2Q-24","r":5.0,"t":"I got it a 2nd time","x":"This is the best so far. You don't need to sharpen it!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the eyeliner smooth and easy to apply, calling it a favorite.","cites":[1,3,4,9,14,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the product runs out or dries up quickly, sometimes lasting only a month or less.","cites":[5,8,10,13]},{"text":"Some reviewers praise that it stays put all day without smudging.","cites":[3,7,9]},{"text":"A few reviewers complain it smudges or is hard to apply evenly and fix mistakes.","cites":[7,11]},{"text":"Some reviewers had trouble getting the self-sharpening pencil to extend or work at all.","cites":[8,10,12]}]},"qa":[]}